hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"171","Nasr bin Ali told us, Abdul Aziz Al-Darawardi told us, on the authority of Zayd bin Aslam, on the authority of Ata’ bin Yassar, on the authority of Ibn Abbas, he said: I saw The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “performed ablution once in a while.”"
